sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Cliente
    participant Gateway as API Gateway
    participant Security as Validador JWT HS256
    participant Consul as Consul Discovery
    participant Service as multitenant-core-service

    Client->>+Gateway: Petición con Authorization Bearer JWT
    Gateway->>+Security: Validar firma, issuer y claim authorities
    Security-->>-Gateway: Token válido (autenticado)
    Note over Gateway,Security: Rutas públicas: login, refresh, logout, health e info
    Gateway->>+Consul: Descubrir servicio
    Consul-->>-Gateway: URI de servicio
    Gateway->>+Service: Reenviar petición
    Service-->>-Gateway: Respuesta (Datos)
    Gateway-->>-Client: Respuesta (Datos)
